 if(s.sinkDepth>k.counterDepth-3)add('SINKRAIL','Insufficient stone around sink',s.sinkDepth+' in cutout within '+k.counterDepth+' in top','Revise sink / counter depth and coordinate front, rear and faucet rail with fabricator','Fabricator','conflict');
